window.products.push({"id":268168,"name":"Stubai 672204 – Hachita with Curved, 600 g","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31SEv6Rqe3L._AC_.jpg","description":"The processing of iron has a long tradition in the Stubai Valley. The area iron mines were of such high quality that in the 14th century blacksmiths in Fulpmes were already producing hand tools. In 1897 engaged craftsmen formed a cooperative (marketed under the Stubai name) to manage the future for both production and sales. Today 26 member factories are processing several thousand tons of steel each year. The production program consists of a wide range of tools for professional users such as metal workers, woodworkers, woodcarvers, woodturners, forestry workers, auto mechanics, roofers, masons, tile setters, electricians and others. Our own forge manufactures products for our members and also semi-finished products for other industries in Austria and other European countries. Approximately half of the production is exported to more than 50 countries worldwide. The brand name \"Stubai\" stands for quality and workmanship. The Stubai Tool industry is the biggest hand tool manufacturer in Austria.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31SEv6Rqe3L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Stubai","source_asin":"B001ISOOY6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-268168","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001ISOOY6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001ISOOY6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":268169,"name":"Evolur Santa Fe Night Stand, Antique Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91aLEikIgxL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Evolur Santa Fe/Cheyenne Nightstand adds a vintage vibe to any space, while providing ample storage for your belongings. A long-lasting buy, its kiln-dried hardwood frame and fine veneers, together with Dovetail joints and a five-piece drawer box construction are a testament to its durability. It draws its design inspiration from Roman architecture as seen in its traditional dentil molding and imperial feet. Contemporary routing and fluting as well as the round wooden knobs offer a subtle contrast. The Santa Fe/Cheyenne comes with one spacious drawer for closed storage while the open shelf offers ample open storage space for those little odds and ends. Mix and match with other pieces from the Evolur Santa Fe/Cheyenne Nursery Collection, such as the Double Dresser and Tall Chest, to create a stylish nursery It comes in three finishes - Antique Brown, Antique Mist, Storm Grey/Steel Grey - that make it perfect for a child’s room and beyond We prioritize safety. Our products are designed and engineered to the highest safety standards that meet/exceed those set by the CPSC/ASTM, wood and Carb II Compliant MDF. Product dimensions: 23.6L X 20W X 25H inches. Comes with a one-year warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91aLEikIgxL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Evolur","source_asin":"B077JS3VQW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-268169","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077JS3VQW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077JS3VQW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":268170,"name":"Department 56 Dickens' Village Strawberry Cottage Lit House, 6.7 inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/919zYukl7WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"One Christmas evening, a group of friends set off to enjoy a dinner of celebration at a small country inn nestled in a quiet river town. As they rounded a bend in the road, they saw the small, old-fashioned village decorated for the holidays. The lights, like fairies, glowed and sparkled amid the freshly fallen snow. All evening, the conversation was full of Christmas memories and the visions the tiny town had evoked. Amidst the jovial banter and magical memories, the idea for a lighted Christmas village was born. That spark of an idea became a reality when, in 1976, Department 56 introduced a series of six hand-painted, ceramic buildings. The rest is history.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/919zYukl7WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Department 56","source_asin":"B00AXTLIFY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-268170","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00AXTLIFY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00AXTLIFY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
