window.products.push({"id":268218,"name":"HOMEIDEAS 100% Natural/Beige Blackout Curtains Textured 84 Inch Burlap Faux Linen Look Curtains Primitive Room Darkening Grommet Curtains for Living B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zmrO3V0PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PAIR SOLD: Each package includes 2 panels of 52\" W x 84\" L textured blackout curtains. Each panel has 8 anti-rust silver grommets with a 1.5\" diameter. 100% BLACKOUT: The backside is produced with a special three-layer coating process that offers total light shielding, turns day into night. These room darkening curtains are the perfect choice for night shifts, college students, nurseries, etc. PREMIUM MATERIAL: Those burlap faux linen look curtains combine style and durability drape well, not easy to get wrinkles, pilling, dust, and still remain the primitive textured look. MULTI-USE FOR: Homeideas grommet curtains are not only beautiful looking but have high performance on soundproof, thermal insulated, energy-efficient, providing privacy, versatile style for any room in your home. EASY CARE: Machine washable in cold water, gentle cycle, tumble dry low. Promptly hang the living room curtains. Cool iron on the linen side as needed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zmrO3V0PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMEIDEAS","source_asin":"B08MTZ2K7T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-268218","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MTZ2K7T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MTZ2K7T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":268219,"name":"OXO Good Grips 0.3 Qt POP Container – Airtight Food Storage – for Spices & Herbs and More","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.4,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51RaY4KSnaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description OXO Good Grips POP Containers are airtight, stackable and space-efficient, making it easy to keep your dry foods fresh and your kitchen organized. For a true airtight seal just push the button, it also pops up to serve handle for the lid. Designed for modular stacking, POP Containers’ square and rectangular shapes make the most out of any storage space, no matter how tight.  POP Containers are available in 11 different sizes: each one is perfectly calibrated to fit common household staples including 5 lb bags of flour and sugar, 1 lb bags of coffee, boxes of cereal, oatmeal, coffee, rice, pasta, spices and more. With curved corners for easy pouring, sturdy, BPA-free construction, and a that lid pops apart (and snaps back together) for thorough cleaning. POP containers aren’t just for your kitchen: use them any place you want more organization! Think playrooms, bathrooms, garage, craft rooms – the possibilities are endless. The OXO Good Grips POP Containers are airtight, stackable and space-efficient, making it easy to keep your dry foods fresh and your kitchen organized. The Containers have a unique push-button mechanism that creates an airtight seal with just one touch. The button also serves as a handle to lift off the lid. The Containers are designed for modular stacking so that you can efficiently organize your countertop and pantry. In addition, with their square and rectangular shapes, the POP Containers make the most of any storage space, while their corners allow for easy pouring. The POP Containers are available in 11 different sizes to meet your dry food storage needs. They are also great for use in the garage, sewing room, play room and more; in fact, the Containers can be used in so many places that you’ll want them POPping up everywhere. The lid comes apart for thorough cleaning. Brand Story By OXO","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51RaY4KSnaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OXO","source_asin":"B07TGDVYSN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-268219","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TGDVYSN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TGDVYSN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
