window.products.push({"id":268269,"name":"Butchers Knife, Handmade Damascus Steel Serbian Cleaver Chopper Kitchen Chef Outdoor Hunting Knife Wenge Wood Handle With Cowhide Leather Sheath, 7x5","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Yohql6jZS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DAMASCUS CLEAVER We are manufacturing a unique and Beautiful Damascus Butcher's Knife with a Rain Drop Pattern Blade. It is best serbian chef cleaver which provides a superb strength and durability. Lubricate Damascus blades Damascus Steel Cleaver & Chopper Knife is made of hand forged Damascus Steel which means it requires a proper care else its blade would be rusted, to maintain its knife blade it should be clean or wash its blade and dry to prevent rust or discoloration. Do not rub the blade roughly rather we preferred to Use a microfiber or cotton cloth. Once you clean and dry the Knife blade, you should lubricate it with a oil to prevent moisture from affecting the blade because it will keep your knife rust free and maintain its beauty. Store it properly to keep it rust free! When not in use knife should be kept in a dry interior environment, so that it will not be affected by moisture or temperature changes. When you are in the field with knife, make sure you do not keep it in a wet environment for longer period. Wenge Wood Knife Handle We preferred to use Wenge wood in Damascus knives due to its hardness and high shock resistance. Wenge is an amazingly unique wood with its dark brown color and striking figure which also gives a delightful appearance. We strongly recommend using oil for maintenance of the Knife Handle. There are many ways to do it. one of them has written below. Procedure Clean and dry the knife handle before oiling. Then Apply a couple of drops on the handle and rub it with your fingertips. In general, we all know if the surface looks ‘wet’ after a 10mins of oiling then it means it cannot be absorbing any more oil. If there are any dull areas remain, then you can apply more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Yohql6jZS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TALHA","source_asin":"B097367BQ4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-268269","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097367BQ4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097367BQ4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":268270,"name":"House, Home and More Skid-Resistant Carpet Indoor Area Rug Floor Mat - Navy Blue - 4 Feet X 4 Feet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Z+igU7SiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"There’s no need to step lightly on your new carpet area rug from House, Home and More! Thanks to its non-slip rubber backing, this rug won’t bunch up or shift under your feet. Your household will appreciate the added stability in your living spaces, especially older adults. Our carpet area rugs protect and add comfort to hard-surface floors and help to reduce noise throughout your home. HOW TO CHOOSE AREA RUGS: Area rugs are great for high-traffic areas, like living rooms and entryways, and add comfort to kitchens, bedrooms and bathrooms. Rug size and color (or pattern) are relative to the size of the room and your personal design choices. In the living room, you generally want a rug size that extends immediately beyond the area of the furniture placed on top of it. When placing a rug (or rugs) in the kitchen or bathroom, you typically want to cover standing areas: in front of the sink or stove, just outside the shower or bathtub, etc. For a bedroom rug, strive for a size that extends beyond the sides and foot of the bed without going underneath nightstands. There are general design practices and recommendations, but in the end, these are personal style choices. ARE CARPET AREA RUGS PET FRIENDLY? Our area rugs provide stability and a cozy place for your pets to rest. The non-slip backing adds traction and creates a more secure setting for your household, including your dogs, cats and other pets. Walking on slippery hard-surface floors can be a difficult daily task for senior dogs and cats. The added comfort and grip of a rug will allow them to move with confidence. If you have pets, consider a color or design that won’t showcase their shedding. HOW TO CARE FOR YOUR CARPET AREA RUG: Our carpet area rugs feature a non-slip rubber backing which helps to keep them in place while vacuuming, but can become damaged if put into a washing machine. When your rug needs cleaning, we recommend vacuuming to remove surface dirt and spot cleaning areas that need extra care.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Z+igU7SiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"House, Home and More","source_asin":"B01CTDBND8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-268270","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01CTDBND8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01CTDBND8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
