window.products.push({"id":268306,"name":"FewwEssentials Dhoop Incense Sticks | Long-Lasting Robust Luxury Premium Dhoop Incense|3 Free Stands | Aromatherapy | Relaxation | Focus | Mediation |","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UzSxqi+HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Highly Fragrant | Grace: The scent notes remind us of sweet sandalwood, myrrh, frankincense, and ceremonial smoke on a crisp night | Users share that the smoke from the FewwEssentials Dhoop Incense sticks invoke instantly vivid positive memories and create a personal space of protection, meditation, and relaxation. Long-lasting | Each Dhoop Incense Sticks Burns for approx. 30 minutes | Smell is one of the most important sensory power with an ability to instantly shift and align vibrational energetic frequencies. FewwEssentials Dhoop Incense are uniquely crafted using the ancient art of incense making from the Eastern world. Inspired by the desire to revive ancient traditions in the present time | Perfect balance of contemporary and rustic design with a focus on beauty, functionality, and harmony with nature. FewwEssentials Dhoop Incense Sticks are packaged in a biodegradable, eco-friendly, sturdy cylindrical container to avoid breakage. Perfect Gift | Easy to use | Directions: ( 1) Light the tip of a Dhoop Incense Stick; (2) Keep the Stick lit for 20-30 seconds until you see an amber cherry, and then blow it out; (3) Push the stick in the hole in the cement stand, place it on a fireproof surface to enjoy the fragrant mesmerizing smoke. Light with Purpose | Each purchase results in a donation to our charity partner Triumphant 2Gether | Each purchase strengthens the efforts to light the way for women and girls impacted by state and community violence.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UzSxqi+HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FewwEssentials","source_asin":"B098KPJ6LM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-268306","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098KPJ6LM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098KPJ6LM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":268307,"name":"ABeadedCurtain 125 String Wooden Door Beaded Curtain 38% More Strands Handmade with 4000 Beads (+Hanging Hardware)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.61,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XuLJgA7BL._AC_SL1084_.jpg","description":"Handmade and hand painted: Each of our beaded curtains begins with approximately 4000 beads cut into 2.5\" sections from natural bamboo stalks. The bamboo beads are then strung together by hand using wire to create a strand. 125 strands are then attached to a wooden hanging bar to create a bamboo beaded curtain. Finally, each bead and strand is individually hand painted producing the art you see on each beaded curtain. Since each bead is entirely painted the image is viewable on both sides of the curtain from any angle. Highest quality with 125 strands: Our hand painted bamboo beaded curtains are the highest quality beaded curtains currently being manufactured. Each bamboo curtain is truly in a class of its own. We have been making beaded curtains since 2001 and have learned by trial, error, and customer feedback. From our experience we have found 125 strands to be the ideal number of strands per curtain. This strand count provides curtain density, durability, and vivid image detail. With less than 125 strands, you lose density and detail in the painting. With greater than 125 strands, the bead diameter becomes too small making the beads fragile and prone to breaking.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XuLJgA7BL._AC_SL1084_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ABeadedCurtain","source_asin":"B003A8PI9C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-268307","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003A8PI9C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003A8PI9C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
