window.products.push({"id":268357,"name":"White Wine Glasses Hand Blown Crystal Clear Glass Stemware Red Wine Glass Set of 2 14-Oz Lead-Free Cups for Wine Tasting Party Drinking or Unique Gift","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51i6VjVGxsL._AC_SL1094_.jpg","description":"Why choose the Cystone Hand-Blown Wine Glasses? Whatever the occasion would be, the glasses with clear crystal appearance is perfect for reds and white such as Sauvignon Blanc, Pinot Gris, Rose, Riesling, Soave and Chablis. Difference of Machine-Made and Hand-Blown Machine-made Wine Glasses The machine-made glasses is cumbersome to control that may come out with poor flow linearity and firmness. Hand-blown Wine Glasses Produced by skilled hand-blown technology, lighter and elegant with excellent flow linearity, reveals their elegance and quality. Red Wine Glasses Details Brand: Cystone Cup Size: 9\" in height Cup Capacity: 15-Ounce Type: Hand Blown Wine Glass Material: Lead-free Crystal Glass Features 1. Large base lends optimal stability when placed on trays, counters, and tables. 2. With ultra clear, pure and stunning wine glasses, giving you the optimal wine presentation and enjoyment. 3. Wine glasses are made of premium quality lead-free crystal glass, scratch-resistant that will last for years. 4. The set includes 2 wine glasses, each offering a 15-ounce capacity, which allows for pleasing portions with room to swirl. 5. The red wine glasses look good and feel good in your hand and on the lip for a more delightful wine drinking experience. 6. These wine glasses are hand-blown through 26 procedures by experienced craft masters who boast more than 10 years experience in this field. NOTES 1. These wine glasses dishwasher-safe for easy cleaning and NOT SAFE for microwave use. 2. Don’t force bowl tightly over dishwasher rack prongs and don’t twist stem and bowl while holding one or the other tightly. PROMISE Please check whether your glasses are in perfect condition after received them. Any defective wine glasses due to the transport, we will send you a new set.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51i6VjVGxsL._AC_SL1094_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cystone","source_asin":"B09MWF7RWQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-268357","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MWF7RWQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MWF7RWQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
