window.products.push({"id":268480,"name":"maryha Under Sink Mat for Kitchen Cabinet - Waterproof Silicone Proctor Tray for Leaks, Drips, Spills - Flexible Shelf Liner with Raised Edge and Drai","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bNv8TuUKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PROTECT YOUR KITCHEN CABINET - Whether your pipes are leaking and you want to prevent water damage or you simply want to keep the under sink cabinet clean, the maryha waterproof sink liner provides excellent coverage and does an amazing job at safeguarding your cabinet, bathroom vanity and floor against scratches, abrasions, stains or water damage! FLEXIBLE SILICONE MATERIAL - Our under kitchen sink liner is made with top-quality silicone, which is flexible but durable and resistant to stains, marks, and wear. Thanks to its smooth silicone surface, the sink mat is extremely easy to clean. The long-lasting durable material will not crack. NO-SPILL DESIGN - The under the sink mat waterproof features a raised lip with a reinforced edge that acts as a barrier to capture water leaking from the pipes and prevent it from spilling into the base cabinet or onto your floors. This under sink organizer can hold up to 3 gallons of water! BUILT-IN DRAINAGE - This silicone sink protector is designed with a built-in drainage hole and a special, anti-slip star pattern that helps reroute the water flow to the drain hole. This feature allows you to easily pour the water from the sink mat, without worrying about making a mess. MULTIPURPOSE USE - Our sink protector mat can be used in any location for a wide range of purposes such as, protecting the under the sink cabinet from water damage, preventing mess caused by pet food, water, dirt from shoes, scratches and abrasions, or as a protective floor liner for tools, accessories, kids’ toys, cleaning products or other household items. The cabinet shelf liner can also be used for organizing the kitchen sink shelf, in the pet crate, litter box, or as a craft/hobby mat.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bNv8TuUKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"maryha","source_asin":"B0BFZ29HJW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-268480","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFZ29HJW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFZ29HJW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":268481,"name":"Kunst & Ambiente Modern Art - Bronze on Marble - Skeleton (The Warrior) - Signed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":699.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xmIk6BXeL._AC_SL1122_.jpg","description":"A very impressive Modern Art Bronze Statue on marble-base! The sculpture was designed by a famous Modern Art artist. The name of this attractive statue is The Warrior. In this case a skeleton is sitting on a skull, armed with spear and defence shield. Statue is made of finest bronze material and casted in our foundry in an amazing agreement to the original. The sculpture is focal point in every exhibition! The sculpture is an absolute eye-catcher for the friends of bronze sculptures or the collectors of Modern. The production is under permanent control and follows the strict quality standards for best bronze articles.   As all of the bronze products in our shop, this exhibit is hand-cast in our own foundry and exclusively compounded with the help oflost-wax casting.   This great sculpture was made by the fabulous Portuguese artist Miguel Fernando Lopez, better known as Milo. Milo was born in 1955 in the beautiful city of Lisbon. The sculptor also studied in Lisbon art at the university and specialized himself in animal sculptures, modern art and nude and act sculptures. Milo is a well-known freelance artist in Europe and we are glad that he is also working for our foundry. He and his family are living in one of the lovely suburbs of Lisbon.   Width: 25 cm  Height: 30 cm  Depth: 14 cm  Weight: 4.8 kg  100% Bronze   Art & Ambiance - Europeans largest sculpture and statue seller. We offer you more than 1000 bronze figures and oil / acrylic paintings.   Art & Ambiance  Breitscheidstr. 38  01237 Dresden  Germany  Tel: +49 - 351-2056447  Mobil: +49 - 177-3590 100  www.art-bronze-sculptures.com","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xmIk6BXeL._AC_SL1122_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kunst & Ambiente","source_asin":"B0069R51PM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-268481","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0069R51PM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0069R51PM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
