window.products.push({"id":268517,"name":"Ambesonne Ladybugs Flat Sheet, Ladybugs Pattern Bunch of Bugs Infinite Speckled Marked Insect Theme Playroom, Soft Comfortable Top Sheet Decorative Be","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.94,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WBTbdeSUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"102 INCHES LONG x 90 INCHES WIDE - 1 piece flat bed top with durable print. Decorative accent piece. MADE FROM - 100% Brushed microfiber fabric. Ultimate comfort and softness for bedroom or guest room. FEATURES - Oversized and lightweight so you can tuck the bedspread under the bed. Soft to the touch. MACHINE WASHABLE - Cold cycle, Dryer safe. Iron easy. With proper care NO FADING NO TEARING. PRINTED - With state of the art digital printing technology. Long-lasting bold colors & clear image. Bring the beauty of colors and style to your bed with our flat sheets. With the high quality of our brand, use your sheets for years. They're long lasting and durable. You'll feel the ultimate comfort and softness. Taste the stylish sleep quality with these gentle sheets. The breathable feature will give you fresh feelings through the night. You can easily combine these sheets with your bedding sets and furniture. Choose between thousands of different and creative patterns. With its oversized design, you can tuck it under the bed and have a peaceful night's sleep; it'll stay put... Colors won't fade thanks to new digital printing methods. It's not too thin or too thick. Adds real value and depth to your decor. Perfect gift idea for your mom, dad, sister, brother, grandma, grandpa, wife, husband, son, daughter and all other beloved ones. It's a clever and fun choice for every bedroom, guest room, dorm, hotel, hostel, motel... It can be given as a housewarming gift, too. The digital images we display have the most accurate color possible, however due to differences in computer monitors, we cannot be responsible for variations in color between the actual product and your screen. Care Instructions: Machine wash with cold water; Do not bleach. Tumble dry on low heat. The fitted sheet is printed on the FRONT SIDE ONLY, the back of them are plain white colored.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WBTbdeSUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ambesonne","source_asin":"B0BXDDKZ8Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-268517","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXDDKZ8Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXDDKZ8Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":268518,"name":"Automatic Vacuum Sealer Machine, Food Sealers Vacuum Packing Machine, ETL Listed Commercial Grade Vacuum Sealer with Memory Function, Built-in Cutter,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MDJq7japL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【Premium Vacuum Sealer Machine】With double-layer air sealing technology, this Vacuum Sealer Machine provides 75kPa vacuum power and 7 times longer reservation time to meat, fruits, nuts, vegetables, snacks etc. It has Dry Mode for dry food and Moist Mode for wet food. When seal the bag, you can choose the one heat sealing or double heat sealing. 【Commercial Grade Vacuum Sealer】With stainless steel housing and ETL certification, this food sealer machine can be used at home or business location. The commercial type sealer has an integrated roll cutter for custom cut bag sizes. With 13'' extended heat sealing strip, the vacuum sealer can vacuum seal 3 bags of food at the same time. Besides, it can work continuously about 50 times and only 5 minutes break later, it can resume working. 【Premium Vacuum Sealer with Memory Function】This vacuum machine can memorize your previous setting about the vacuum mode (Dry or Moist mode) and the sealing mode (One heat sealing or Double heat sealing), which is a very friendly design and save your time. 【Easy to Operate with Digital Panel】The digital touch button control is placed on the top panel, along w/ LED indicator lights. When the indicator lights stop flashing, you can start vacuum sealing. Cut the bag, seal one end, fill in the food and vacuum seal the other end. The cover is super easy to lock by turning the side button. The “Outside Vac” supports vacuum jars or bottles that have specific exhaust hole(3mm) on the top. 【Save Money and Stay Fresh】This vacuum sealer machine makes no sound when sealing a bag. It comes with 5 big vacuum bags(11''x13.8''), 5 medium vacuum bags(8.7''x13.8''), 1 vacuum seal bag roll(13''x196.8''), 5 reusable and washable vacuum bags, an air suction hose, and a detachable power cable. We provide 12-Month warranty from the purchase date. Any problem, feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MDJq7japL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fresh World","source_asin":"B08BR8298X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-268518","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BR8298X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BR8298X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
