window.products.push({"id":268595,"name":"Prenn Candles | Vanilla Bourbon Large Luxury Scented Soy Wax Jar Candle | 3D Glass Jar with Outer Paint, Milk White | Small Jar Candles for Gift, Roma","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41lY067smOS._AC_.jpg","description":"Prenn Premium Glass Jar Candles is made from high-quality soy wax and has a pure cotton wick braised specifically for scented candles aromatherapy. The result is a candle that burns cleanly, with a long and stable bright flame and no harmful paraffin soot, non-toxic. Due to soy wax low melting temperature, the scent will never become weak it will stay the same during all time of use. The English prairie after the rain, sweet and creamy vanilla, like old whiskey, mellow and soft, with a long aftertaste. The milk, vanilla, and aged bourbon collide along with hints of fruitiness that are discovered through a lingering, healthy sip over ice. This brings the special scent for a warming dinner with your lover. Top Note: Milk, ice cream Middle Note: Vanilla Base Note: Whiskey Care instructions To prevent fire, burn within sight. Keep away from things that can catch fire. Keep away from children and pets. Burn on a heat-safe surface. For best results, burn until wax melts evenly across the container, not exceeding 4 hours. Keep wax pool free of debris. Keep wick centered and trim to 1/4\" each time the candle is lit. Avoid drafts. Never touch or move a hot or lit candle. Stop burning when 1/2\" of wax remains. We are conscious of being eco-friendly and limiting waste. You will get great metal colorful jars, so we will be really happy if you REUSE THE GLASS JAR to hold your cotton pads, hair clips, paper clips, Plant A Small Tree, etc... Ingredients: Natural Soy Wax, Pure Natural Essential Oils and Fragrance, and Colorant.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41lY067smOS._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Prenn Candles","source_asin":"B08ND9TQFN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-268595","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ND9TQFN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ND9TQFN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
