window.products.push({"id":268609,"name":"Quantum Mechanix Stargate SG-1 Replica Mirror","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":450.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91gB9M1H7WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Approximately 25 cm across and made of durable polystone and glass, the Stargate SG-1 Replica Mirror is an exact scale recreation of the stargate used in the long-running TV series, Stargate SG-1.Taken from the CGI files used on the show, the mirror has a removable clear blue overlay – so you can display it either in mirror mode or with the 'event horizon' effect in place – and is hand painted with all 39 chevrons in their proper positions around the ring. The integrated wall hanger on the back of the mirror makes it easy to display at home, in your office or in your SGC ready room.Make no mistake: This is an exact replica which has been sculpted using the original computer files supplied by MGM Studios. Each replica is detailed using seven different colors to simulate the patina as seen on the real stargate. And all 39 chevrons are sculpted exactly as they appear on the show and in their proper positions around the ring.The Stargate Replica Mirror comes in a full cover box with Styrofoam inserts. We expect these to go faster than a Goa'uld mothership, so place your order now and soon you too can explore the galaxy with your very own Stargate!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91gB9M1H7WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Quantum Mechanix","source_asin":"B0015KMRG4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-268609","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0015KMRG4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0015KMRG4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
