window.products.push({"id":268622,"name":"Hamilton Beach 2.5 Gallon Humidifier with Electronic Humidistat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41YBGHRGPDL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description Hamilton Beach 05518 - 2.5 Gallon Cool Mist Humidifier Dish Washer Safe. EasyClean System: Cleaning your humidifier shouldn't be a chore. Our water tank and tray are designed to be washed in the dishwasher, leaving them thoroughly clean and sanitary. Easy Drop-In Water Filter: Changing a humidifier filter doesn't have to be a messy inconvenience. Thanks to our drop-in filter, you just pull the old filter out and drop the new one in - it's that easy. Durable Construction: This humidifier delivers durability and performance you can count on. From top to bottom, it's built with heavy-duty materials that will last for years. Large EasyFill Tank: Features an extra-large opening for easy filling and a \"leg hugging\" indentation for easy carrying. Water tank adds the capacity for up to 24-hour operation. Enjoy Quiet Operation : Keep the noise down and increase your humidity at the same time - it's so quiet, you may forget it's on. The low QuietMist setting is perfect for bedrooms. Amazon.com This basic member of the Hamilton Beach Cool Mist family dispenses with frills such as automatic humidity control but retains a sleek, convenient oval design. Because the controls are on one end of the oval rather than the side, the unit can be operated easily even if placed in a narrow space. (It's 10 inches wide and about 17 inches deep.) The single control knob operates a two-speed fan, which means your only options are Quiet Mist and High settings; the latter is pretty noisy, but the former will probably do the trick in most circumstances. The curvy, translucent gray rear tank lifts off easily for refilling, as does the front fan unit for changing or rinsing the drop-in filter. The water tank is dishwasher-safe. --Richard Farr","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41YBGHRGPDL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hamilton Beach","source_asin":"B000050AP0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-268622","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000050AP0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000050AP0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
