window.products.push({"id":268693,"name":"NUTRIUPS Tiered Fruit Basket 3 Tier Fruit Stand 3 Tier Fruit Basket for Kitchen Countertop Black Fruit Bowls, Tiered Fruit Stand for Storing & Organiz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61awnaJ6koL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🥑Large Capacity, Easy Storage🥭: Compared with one tier fruit baskets, NUTRIUPS 3 tier fruit basket for counter is assembled of 5 Inch, 9 Inch and 12 Inch plates. NUTRIUPS 3 tier fruit basket can hold a ton of small to medium-sized fruits and vegetables, and this tiered fruit basket helps you get the most out of your counter space, especially for limited counter space! 🍫Modern Design and Classic Three Colors🍇: Simple and gracious design of the tiered fruit basket & three classic colors (Chocolate Brown Black, Laurel Gold and Magnolia White). Add an appealing decoration with modern 3 tier fruit basket to your home and suit for different activities like birthday parties, cocktail parties and weddings. 🥝Keep Fruits & Vegetables Fresh🍑: The tiered fruit basket for kitchen, grabs fruits easily, efficiently aerates fruits & vegetables instead of storing them in refrigerator, prevents fruits from over-ripening. The fruit basket keeps fruits fresh for a longer time and helps your family ingest fruits rather than candy. Enjoy healthy and nutritious fruits with NUTRIUPS tiered fruit basket! 🍌High Quality & Sturdy Structure💖: With the middle thicker tube, the 3 tier fruit basket can excellently keep the balance to hold more fruits. Special powder coating fruit basket greatly reduces the possibility of rust and flaking paint. There are 4 rubber non-slip feet of the tiered fruit basket to prevent scratching the countertop or cabinet. The smooth surface of the 3 tier countertop fruit basket allows you to clean it up easily. 💝Diverse Functions🍓: Tiered fruit baskets can not only help you classify different fruits and vegetables, but also sort out desserts and snacks, and even your small easy-to-lose clutter like rings and earrings, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61awnaJ6koL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NUTRIUPS","source_asin":"B08BCR16PL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-268693","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BCR16PL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BCR16PL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
