window.products.push({"id":268869,"name":"Tupperware FRIDGESMART LARGE 19c Veges Fruit Salad NEW","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ki3xBPFrL._AC_SL1126_.jpg","description":"There's never been anything like FridgeSmart containers, try and you'll see why. Virtually any fresh-picked produce will last longer and taste better stored in FridgeSmart containers. Regulate the airflow within the container thanks to a unique venting system and a permanent storage chart molded into container. Special built-in grid lifts food away from condensation. Result, No more yellow broccoli and wasted celery. Fruits and vegetables have different airflow needs when stored in the fridge. Use the FridgeSmart Storage Chart printed on side for the best vent settings for your favorite fruits and vegetables.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ki3xBPFrL._AC_SL1126_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tupperware","source_asin":"B004TUTMLA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-268869","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004TUTMLA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004TUTMLA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
